# Antigravity & Agent Rules

## Styling Rules
1. **Interactive Elements:** All buttons (`<button>`) and links (`<Link>`, `<a>`) must explicitly display a pointer cursor. This is handled globally in `globals.css`, but if adding custom isolated components, always ensure `cursor-pointer` is applied via Tailwind or CSS.
2. **Buttons:** Disabled buttons must have `cursor-not-allowed` and an opacity reduction.

## Workflow Rules
- Always verify design aesthetics before committing frontend changes. Look for ways to make the design more premium.

## SEO & Indexing Rules
1. **Indexed Pages:** Every public, indexable page MUST explicitly export `metadata` containing `title`, `description` and `keywords`. No exceptions.
2. **Authenticated/Private Pages:** Any authenticated or private page (e.g. `/dashboard`) MUST have `robots: { index: false, follow: false }` and MUST NOT contain SEO metadata like `description` or `keywords` (only a `title` for the browser tab).
